The correctness failure is from a stride bug: `torch.split` on the combined projection creates views with a last-dimension stride layout of 640, while my Triton gate kernel treated them as compact `[B,N,N,H]`. I’m changing the kernel to read directly from the packed projection buffer with explicit offsets.
